version 3
run LMacWithUnitDiskRadio-0-20261026-16:52:55-4539
attr configname LMacWithUnitDiskRadio
attr datetime 20261026-16:52:55
attr datetimef 20261026-165255
attr experiment LMacWithUnitDiskRadio
attr inifile omnetpp.ini
attr iterationvars ""
attr iterationvarsd ""
attr iterationvarsf ""
attr measurement ""
attr network TestNic
attr processid 4539
attr repetition 0
attr replication #0
attr resultdir results
attr runnumber 0
